      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metamora%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Metamora Area Historical Society, founded in 2004, preserves local heritage as a member of the Fulton County Historical Alliance.",
